/45\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"6-1-2\" data-name=\"experience section divider line\" data-reason=\"scaleX width drawn in by scroll trigger\"></div>\n<div class=\"mt-2\" data-kid=\"6-1-3\" data-name=\"experience list container\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 border-b border-[#CFAB01]/15 py-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-1\" data-name=\"experience entry for Fintrail\">\n<div data-kid=\"6-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Fintrail entry details\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-7 gap-y-2\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Fintrail entry header\">\n<h3 class=\"deco text-[28px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Fintrail company name\">Fintrail</h3>\n<span class=\"deco text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-[#F0ECEC]/65\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Fintrail role title\">Senior product designer</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"serif mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.55] text-[#F0ECEC]/60\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Fintrail project description\">Payments, onboarding and the design system.</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"deco text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] text-[#CFAB01]/80\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Fintrail date range\">2022 — present</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 border-b border-[#CFAB01]/15 py-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2\" data-name=\"experience entry for Sundial Studio\">\n<div data-kid=\"6-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Sundial Studio entry details\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-7 gap-y-2\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Sundial Studio entry header\">\n<h3 class=\"deco text-[28px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Sundial Studio company name\">Sundial Studio</h3>\n<span class=\"deco text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-[#F0ECEC]/65\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Sundial Studio role title\">Product designer</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"serif mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.55] text-[#F0ECEC]/60\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Sundial Studio project description\">Booking and travel products for three clients.</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"deco text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] text-[#CFAB01]/80\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Sundial Studio date range\">2019 — 2022</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 border-b border-[#CFAB01]/15 py-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-3\" data-name=\"experience entry for Pageturn Press\">\n<div data-kid=\"6-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"Pageturn Press entry details\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-7 gap-y-2\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Pageturn Press entry header\">\n<h3 class=\"deco text-[28px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Pageturn Press company name\">Pageturn Press</h3>\n<span class=\"deco text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.26em] text-[#F0ECEC]/65\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Pageturn Press role title\">Interface designer</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"serif mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.55] text-[#F0ECEC]/60\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Pageturn Press project description\">Digital editions of a 90-year-old imprint.</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"deco text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] text-[#CFAB01]/80\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"Pageturn Press date range\">2017 — 2019</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"border-t border-[#CFAB01]/20\" data-kid=\"7\" data-name=\"education and skills section\" id=\"education\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1180px] gap-6 px-10 py-24 md:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"7-1\" data-name=\"section content grid\">\n<div class=\"notch border border-[#CFAB01]/30 p-3\" data-kid=\"7-1-1\" data-name=\"notched card for education\">\n<div class=\"notch border border-[#CFAB01]/18 p-3\" data-kid=\"7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"education inner notched border\">\n<div class=\"notch bg-[#141014] px-8 py-8\" data-kid=\"7-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"education card inner panel\">\n<h2 class=\"deco text-[26px] leading-none\" data-kid=\"7-1-1-1-1-1\" d