\"1-2-2-3-7-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76a568]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-7-1-1\"></span>Bespoke</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"border-b border-[#eceae1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\">\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[10px] text-[#98a298]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\">03</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-1\">Grand Line</span><span class=\"ml-2 text-[11px] text-[#879186]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-2-2\">One Piece</span></td>\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-3\">grand-line</td>\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-4\">magnet</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-5\"><span class=\"flex h-3.5 w-16 overflow-hidden rounded-[3px] ring-1 ring-black/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-5-1\"><i class=\"h-full flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-5-1-1\" style=\"background:#C8842B\"></i><i class=\"h-full flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-5-1-2\" style=\"background:#0B2B3C\"></i><i class=\"h-full flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-5-1-3\" style=\"background:#F6EFDF\"></i></span></td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5 text-[11.5px] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-6\">Poster hero, wave divider, plunder grid</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#35634d]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1\" data-name=\"designed state indicator\" data-reason=\"state badge markup and innerHTML regenerated from template data by script\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76a568]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-7-1-1\" data-name=\"designed status dot\" data-reason=\"dot markup regenerated by the registry script alongside the badge text\"></span>Bespoke</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"border-b border-[#eceae1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5\">\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[10px] text-[#98a298]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-1\">04</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\" data-k