" data-kid=\"1-2-2-24-5-1-3\" style=\"background:#F0ECE4\"></i></span></td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5 text-[11.5px] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-24-6\">Rugged poster, worn rules</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-24-7\" data-name=\"all-bespoke state indicator\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#35634d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-24-7-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76a568]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-24-7-1-1\" data-name=\"all-bespoke status dot\"></span>Bespoke</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"border-b border-[#dedfd5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25\">\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[10px] text-[#98a298]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-1\">22</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-2-1\">Longship</span><span class=\"ml-2 text-[11px] text-[#879186]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-2-2\">Vikings</span></td>\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-3\" data-name=\"dedicated layout identifier\">longship</td>\n<td class=\"spec py-2.5 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-4\">tilt</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-5\"><span class=\"flex h-3.5 w-16 overflow-hidden rounded-[3px] ring-1 ring-black/10\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-5-1\"><i class=\"h-full flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-5-1-1\" style=\"background:#8C1C13\"></i><i class=\"h-full flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-5-1-2\" style=\"background:#12100D\"></i><i class=\"h-full flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-5-1-3\" style=\"background:#C1732B\"></i></span></td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5 text-[11.5px] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-6\">Longhouse hero, rune rails</td>\n<td class=\"py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-7\" data-name=\"all-bespoke state indicator\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[#35634d]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-7-1\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76a568]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-25-7-1-1\" data-name=\"all-bespoke status dot\"></span>Bespoke</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 border-t border-[#dedfd5] pt-4 md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n<p class=\"spec text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#93a094]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">State</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"all-bespoke state description\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76a568]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\"></span>Bespoke: its own React layout file, ported from its canvas page. All 22 templates.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"archetype-only state description\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#76a568] opacity-60\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-1\"></span>Archetype-only: none left. Konoha Ink, Arc Reactor, Gotham Nocturne and Dream House share the archetype file written from their own page.</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2\">\n<p class=\"spec text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#93a094]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\">Layout families</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"layout families summary\">18 dedicated layout files, 4 shared: scroll, hud, deco, packaging. scene and editorial idle.</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-3\">\n<p class=\"spec text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#93a094]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\">Motion usage</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[11.5px] leading-[1.7] text-[#68756c]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\">16 mechanics, all bound by a layout. No mechanic repeats inside one family.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>",
