      "html": "<body class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F4EEDC] text-[#3C3A2A] antialiased\" data-template-root=\"\" style=\"font-family:'Nunito','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif\">\n<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n  .display { font-family: 'Fredoka', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; }\n  .mono { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; }\n  .rail { scrollbar-width: none; -ms-overflow-style: none; }\n  .rail::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 0; }\n  .card-lift { transition: transform 220ms cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), box-shadow 220ms ease; }\n  .card-lift:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 18px 34px -22px rgba(60, 58, 42, 0.55); }\n  .photo-wash { background: radial-gradient(760px circle at var(--caustic-x, 30%) var(--caustic-y, 12%), rgba(110, 155, 87, 0.34), rgba(110, 155, 87, 0) 68%); }\n</style>\n<header class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 px-4 pt-4 md:px-8 md:pt-5\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"sticky page header\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1180px] items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#F4EEDC]/92 px-3 py-2 shadow-[0_10px_30px_-24px_rgba(60,58,42,0.7)] backdrop-blur-md sm:px-5\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"rounded pill navigation bar\">\n<a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"site logo link\" href=\"#top\">\n<span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#6E9B57] text-[11px] font-bold text-[#FFFDF4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"monogram initial avatar\">AM</span>\n<span class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] sm:block\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"full site name label\">Aarav Menon</span>\n<span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] sm:hidden\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"abbreviated site name label\">Aarav</span>\n</a>\n<nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-6 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#84795F] md:flex\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"desktop navigation links\">\n<a class=\"hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"work section nav link\" href=\"#work\">Work</a>\n<a class=\"hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"experience section nav link\" href=\"#experience\">Experience</a>\n<a class=\"hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"education section nav link\" href=\"#education\">Education</a>\n</nav>\n<a class=\"rounded-full bg-[#3C3A2A] px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#F4EEDC] hover:bg-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"contact call-to-action button\" href=\"#elsewhere\">Contact</a>\n</div>\n</header>\n<section class=\"px-4 pt-5 md:px-8 md:pt-6\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"hero section\" id=\"top\">\n<div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1180px] overflow-hidden rounded-[34px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB]\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"hero card with textured background\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"photo-wash pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"decorative radial gradient highlight\"></div>\n<div class=\"relative px-6 pt-11 md:px-14 md:pt-16\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"hero content container\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"role badge row\">\n<span class=\"rounded-full bg-[#6E9B57] px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#FFFDF4]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"role badge label\">Interface designer</span>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"display mt-5 max-w-[15ch] text-[46px] leading-[0.98] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] sm:text-[60px] md:text-[82px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero headline\">\n        Aarav Menon\n      </h1>\n<p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[54ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.72] text-[#3C3A2A]/80 md:text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero description paragraph\">\n        I design booking, payment and publishing interfaces. Eight years in, most of it spent making\n        dense screens feel calm enough to use on a phone at a bus stop.\n      </p>\n<div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2 pb-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"profile links row\">\n<a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60 hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"GitHub profile pill link\" href=\"https://github.com\">GitHub</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60 hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"Dribbble profile pill link\" href=\"https://dribbble.com\">Dribbble</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60 hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"LinkedIn profile pill link\" href=\"https://linkedin.com\">LinkedIn</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#3C3A2A] hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60 hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"email contact pill link\" href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">Email</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative block w-full\" data-kid=\"2-1-3\" data-name=\"decorative wave divider\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 1180 170\">\n<path d=\"M0 118 C 150 52 300 138 452 108 C 610 76 742 156 878 112 C 986 78 1082 106 1180 86 L1180 170 L0 170 Z\" fill=\"#6E9B57\" opacity=\"0.26\"></path>\n<path d=\"M0 146 C 190 92 352 164 520 138 C 700 110 848 172 1004 136 C 1090 116 1140 130 1180 122 L1180 170 L0 170 Z\" fill=\"#6E9B57\" opacity=\"0.46\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"px-4 pt-6 md:px-8 md:pt-7\" data-kid=\"3\" data-name=\"skills section\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px] rounded-[26px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB]/70 px-5 py-5 md:px-8 md:py-6\" data-kid=\"3-1\" data-name=\"skills display card\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"3-1-1\" data-name=\"skills pill row\">\n<span class=\"mono mr-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"skills section label\">Skills</span>\n<span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"design systems skill pill\">Design systems</span>\n<span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"interaction design skill pill\">Interaction design</span>\n<span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-4\" data-name=\"prototyping skill pill\">Prototyping</span>\n<span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-5\" data-name=\"motion skill pill\">Motion</span>\n<span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-6\" data-name=\"type skill pill\">Type</span>\n<span class=\"rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/12 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-7\" data-name=\"research skill pill\">Research</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"px-4 pt-12 md:px-8 md:pt-16\" data-kid=\"4\" data-name=\"selected work section\" id=\"work\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px]\" data-kid=\"4-1\" data-name=\"work section content\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3 px-1\" data-kid=\"4-1-1\" data-name=\"work section header\">\n<h2 class=\"display text-[26px] font-semibold md:text-[32px]\" data-kid=\"4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"work section title\">Selected work</h2>\n<span class=\"mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.16em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"work section year range\">2023 — 2025</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rail mt-6 flex snap-x snap-mandatory gap-4 overflow-x-auto pb-3 md:gap-5\" data-kid=\"4-1-2\" data-name=\"horizontal scroll project rail\">\n<article class=\"card-lift snap-start min-w-[280px] max-w-[400px] flex-1 rounded-[26px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] p-6\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"work project card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"project card header row\">\n<span class=\"mono rounded-full bg-[#F4EEDC] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"project year badge\">2025</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative sparkline chart icon\" height=\"22\" viewbox=\"0 0 34 22\" width=\"34\">\n<path d=\"M1 20 C 7 8 12 6 17 13 C 22 20 27 9 33 2\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.75\" stroke=\"#6E9B57\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"display mt-6 text-[22px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"project card title\">Kestrel</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#3C3A2A]/75\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"project card description\">\n          A 240-component library and the token pipeline behind it, adopted by four product teams.\n        </p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card-lift snap-start min-w-[280px] max-w-[400px] flex-1 rounded-[26px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] p-6\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"work project card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"project card header row\">\n<span class=\"mono rounded-full bg-[#F4EEDC] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"project year badge\">2024</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative sparkline chart icon\" height=\"22\" viewbox=\"0 0 34 22\" width=\"34\">\n<path d=\"M1 18 C 8 18 10 5 17 5 C 24 5 26 17 33 17\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.75\" stroke=\"#6E9B57\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"display mt-6 text-[22px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"project card title\">Tide &amp; Timber</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#3C3A2A]/75\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"project card description\">\n          Seat, cabin and ferry availability in one calendar. Cut booking drop-off by a third.\n        </p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"card-lift snap-start min-w-[280px] max-w-[400px] flex-1 rounded-[26px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] p-6\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"work project card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"project card header row\">\n<span class=\"mono rounded-full bg-[#F4EEDC] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.14em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"project year badge\">2023</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative sparkline chart icon\" height=\"22\" viewbox=\"0 0 34 22\" width=\"34\">\n<path d=\"M1 12 C 7 12 8 3 14 3 C 20 3 21 19 27 19 C 30 19 31 14 33 11\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0.75\" stroke=\"#6E9B57\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></path>\n</svg>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"display mt-6 text-[22px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"project card title\">Loom Audio</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-[#3C3A2A]/75\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"project card description\">\n          A reading surface for long-form audio transcripts, built for one-handed use.\n        </p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"px-4 pt-12 md:px-8 md:pt-16\" data-kid=\"5\" data-name=\"experience section\" id=\"experience\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px]\" data-kid=\"5-1\" data-name=\"experience section container\">\n<h2 class=\"display px-1 text-[26px] font-semibold md:text-[32px]\" data-kid=\"5-1-1\" data-name=\"experience section title\">Experience</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-6 space-y-3\" data-kid=\"5-1-2\" data-name=\"experience list\">\n<li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[22px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-5 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"experience entry row\">\n<div data-kid=\"5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job title and company container\">\n<p class=\"display text-[18px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">Senior product designer</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"company name text\">Fintrail</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"mono w-fit rounded-full bg-[#E9E1CB] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"employment duration badge\">2022 — present</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[22px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-5 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"experience entry row\">\n<div data-kid=\"5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"job title and company container\">\n<p class=\"display text-[18px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">Product designer</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"company name text\">Sundial Studio</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"mono w-fit rounded-full bg-[#E9E1CB] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"employment duration badge\">2019 — 2022</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-[22px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#F4EEDC] px-5 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-7\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-3\" data-name=\"experience entry row\">\n<div data-kid=\"5-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"job title and company container\">\n<p class=\"display text-[18px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"job title text\">Interface designer</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"company name text\">Pageturn Press</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"mono w-fit rounded-full bg-[#E9E1CB] px-3 py-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"employment duration badge\">2017 — 2019</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"px-4 pt-12 md:px-8 md:pt-16\" data-kid=\"6\" data-name=\"education section\" id=\"education\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px] rounded-[30px] border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] p-4 md:p-6\" data-kid=\"6-1\" data-name=\"education display card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-3 px-2 pb-4\" data-kid=\"6-1-1\" data-name=\"education header row\">\n<h2 class=\"display text-[26px] font-semibold md:text-[32px]\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"education section title\">Education</h2>\n<span class=\"mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"education year range label\">2013 — 2017</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"6-1-2\" data-name=\"education grid container\">\n<div class=\"rounded-[22px] bg-[#F4EEDC] p-5\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"education entry card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"education year row\">\n<span class=\"mono text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"education year range\">2015 — 2017</span>\n<span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#6E9B57]/30\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative divider line\"></span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"display mt-4 text-[19px] font-semibold leading-snug\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"institution name heading\">National Institute of Design</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"degree description text\">Interaction design</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rounded-[22px] bg-[#F4EEDC] p-5\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"education entry card\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"education year row\">\n<span class=\"mono text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"education year range\">2013 — 2015</span>\n<span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#6E9B57]/30\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative divider line\"></span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"display mt-4 text-[19px] font-semibold leading-snug\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"institution name heading\">Srishti Institute</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#84795F]\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"degree description text\">Foundation studies</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"px-4 pt-12 pb-14 md:px-8 md:pt-16 md:pb-20\" data-kid=\"7\" data-name=\"elsewhere section\" id=\"elsewhere\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1180px]\" data-kid=\"7-1\" data-name=\"elsewhere section container\">\n<h2 class=\"display px-1 text-[26px] font-semibold md:text-[32px]\" data-kid=\"7-1-1\" data-name=\"elsewhere section title\">Elsewhere</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3\" data-kid=\"7-1-2\" data-name=\"social links row\">\n<a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] px-5 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-1\" data-name=\"GitHub social pill link\" href=\"https://github.com\">\n<span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"decorative dot indicator\"></span>GitHub\n      </a>\n<a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] px-5 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Dribbble social pill link\" href=\"https://dribbble.com\">\n<span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"decorative dot indicator\"></span>Dribbble\n      </a>\n<a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] px-5 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-3\" data-name=\"LinkedIn social pill link\" href=\"https://linkedin.com\">\n<span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"decorative dot indicator\"></span>LinkedIn\n      </a>\n<a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#3C3A2A]/10 bg-[#E9E1CB] px-5 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold hover:border-[#6E9B57]/60\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-4\" data-name=\"email social pill link\" href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">\n<span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"7-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"decorative dot indicator\"></span>Email\n      </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"border-t border-[#3C3A2A]/10 px-4 py-8 md:px-8\" data-kid=\"8\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1180px] flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"8-1\" data-name=\"footer content row\">\n<span class=\"display text-[15px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"8-1-1\" data-name=\"footer name label\">Aarav Menon</span>\n<a class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#84795F] hover:text-[#6E9B57]\" data-kid=\"8-1-2\" data-name=\"back to top link\" href=\"#top\">Back to top</a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</body>",
